<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <section id="carriers" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="320" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
            <group id="ghtk" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>GHTK (Giao Hàng Tiết Kiệm)</label>
                <field id="active" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="title" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Title</label>
                </field>
                <field id="name" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Method Name</label>
                </field>
                <field id="api_base_url" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>API Base URL (runtime default; do not change unless proxy/test)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="api_token" translate="label" type="obscure" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>API Token</label>
                    <backend_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Backend\Encrypted</backend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="x_client_source" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="60" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>X-Client-Source (Partner Code, plaintext)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="transport" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="70" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Transport (default)</label>
                    <source_model>Secomm\Ghtk\Model\Config\Source\Transport</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="pick_address_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="80" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Pickup Address ID (GHTK-registered — skips pickup mapping)</label>
                    <comment>Legacy override. When all four pickup fields are empty, the origin falls back to the Magento Shipping Origin (Stores → Configuration → Sales → Shipping Settings → Origin), normalized to GHTK names. A partially filled override invalidates the pickup (carrier hidden) rather than falling back silently.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="pick_province" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="90" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Pickup Province (legacy override — required when no Pickup Address ID)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="pick_district" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="100" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Pickup District (legacy override — optional)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="pick_ward" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="110" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Pickup Ward (legacy override — required when no Pickup Address ID)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="weight_unit" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="120" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Product Weight Unit</label>
                    <source_model>Secomm\Ghtk\Model\Config\Source\WeightUnit</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="min_weight" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="130" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Min/Default Weight (per item, in configured unit)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="rate_include" translate="label" type="multiselect" sortOrder="140" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Include in Displayed Amount (on top of base fee)</label>
                    <source_model>Secomm\Ghtk\Model\Config\Source\RateInclude</source_model>
                    <comment>Base fee.fee is always included. Select additional components.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="webhook_secret" translate="label" type="obscure" sortOrder="146" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="0" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Tracking Webhook Secret (appended to webhook URL)</label>
                    <backend_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Backend\Encrypted</backend_model>
                    <comment>Set a random string and append ?secret=... to the webhook URL configured in the GHTK dashboard: https://&lt;store&gt;/ghtk/webhook/index?secret=&lt;value&gt;. Empty disables the check. GHTK provides no request signing.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="tracking_refresh_enabled" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="147" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="0" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Tracking Reconciliation Cron (fallback for missed webhooks)</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                    <comment>Webhook is the primary update source. When enabled, a light cron re-checks stale, non-delivered/returned/cancelled GHTK shipments via the Tracking Status API. Default: No.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="tracking_refresh_threshold_hours" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="148" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="0" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Reconciliation Staleness Threshold (hours)</label>
                    <comment>Only shipments not synced within this many hours are re-checked. Default: 6.</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="timeout_connect" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="150" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Connection Timeout (seconds)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="timeout_total" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="160" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Total Request Timeout (seconds)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="retry_max" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="170" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Max Retries (network errors only; never 4xx)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="cache_ttl" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="180" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Rate Cache TTL (seconds)</label>
                </field>
                <field id="sallowspecific" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="190" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Ship to Applicable Countries</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Shipping\Model\Config\Source\Allspecificcountries</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="specificcountry" translate="label" type="multiselect" sortOrder="200" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Ship to Specific Countries</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Directory\Model\Config\Source\Country</source_model>
                    <can_be_empty>1</can_be_empty>
                </field>
                <field id="showmethod" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="210" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Show Method if Not Applicable</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="specificerrmsg" translate="label" type="textarea" sortOrder="220" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Displayed Error Message</label>
                </field>
                <field id="sort_order" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="230" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="0">
                    <label>Sort Order</label>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
